course: dictionary
lesson: 6243
title: One word, many meanings
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: One word can have several meanings, and the words around it show you which one is meant. The word model is a good example. «A globe is a small round model of the Earth» means a small copy of something, a thing that shows what the real thing looks like.
explain: Model can also mean a person who wears clothes for photos, or a good example to copy, as in «a model pupil». Read the words around it and ask: which meaning fits this sentence? Then swap your meaning in and check that the sentence still makes sense.
explain: Model can also be a doing word. To model is to shape something, like modelling clay, or to show someone how to do something. The ending changes the word: models, modelled, modelling. Look at the rest of the sentence to see which job the word is doing.
fact: A model is a small copy of something, like a model car, plane or ship.
fact: «A globe is a small round model of the Earth that shows the true shapes of the lands and seas.»
fact: A model can be a person who wears clothes for photos or shows.
fact: «A model pupil» means a good example for others to copy.
fact: To model is a verb: it means to shape something, or to show how to do it.
exercise: «A globe is a small round model of the Earth.» What is a model in this sentence? | *A small copy of something | A person who wears clothes | A tall building | To shape clay
exercise: Priya says, «She is a model pupil, always kind and always on time.» What does model mean here? | To shape something | A small copy of a ship | A person in a photo shoot | *A good example to copy
exercise: «The artist models the clay into a small bird.» Find and copy the word that is a doing word. | *models | artist | clay | small
test: Tom's dad says, «Look at the newest model of the phone.» What does model mean here? | A person who wears clothes for photos | To show how to do something | *A kind or type of a product | A drawing in maths
test: Maya draws a plan that shows how the water cycle works in science. Which word fits? Her plan is a ... | sample | *model | photo | ladder
exam: Ella reads, «Write a model answer for your maths homework.» What does model answer mean? | A person who answers questions | *A good answer to copy as an example | To shape an answer in clay | A small copy of an answer
